Subject: [PATCH] HWUI: map both native 8888 layouts to the Android bitmap config

Imported Mesa hardware buffers may retain BGRA storage. Both
layouts represent Bitmap.Config.ARGB_8888. Normalize the native color-type
mapping so the original Bitmap JNI can be registered without an override.

--- a/libs/hwui/jni/Graphics.cpp
+++ b/libs/hwui/jni/Graphics.cpp
@@ -361,7 +361,8 @@
     switch (colorType) {
         case kRGBA_F16_SkColorType:
             return kRGBA_16F_LegacyBitmapConfig;
-        case kN32_SkColorType:
+        case kRGBA_8888_SkColorType:
+        case kBGRA_8888_SkColorType:
             return kARGB_8888_LegacyBitmapConfig;
         case kARGB_4444_SkColorType:
             return kARGB_4444_LegacyBitmapConfig;
